cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this dataset, please cite it as below and link to https://grassyknees.com/data."
type: dataset
title: "Family activities by U.S. metro area"
abstract: >-
  Weekly per-metro counts of kids' and family activities listed on Grassy Knees
  (grassyknees.com) across 42 U.S. metropolitan areas: current listings, events in
  the next 30 days and the free share, programs, places, activity categories,
  median paid ticket price and towns with listings. Every listing is researched
  from the organizer's own page and re-checked daily. Counts only, no individual listings.
authors:
